["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebranding in a war zone, with Prosper Global (formerly Mercy Corps) From Hormuz to Hunger Gaza Sky Geeks USAID\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-masterscale-慈善机构改名-为什么比企业改名更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a46e1455d559a76a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">26:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>慈善機構改名，為什麼比企業改名更危險</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mercy Corps 改名 Prosper Global，不是因為戰略變了，而是舊名字裝不下它已經在做的事——但改名在衝突地區可能讓員工更危險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道援助</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌重塑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gabe Stengel - Building Investing Superintelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.492] harness MNPI IC memo DDQ CIM compaction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-ilt-ai-时代最值钱的不是智能-是审计轨迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/43ac9b62bb7e7549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代最值錢的不是智能，是審計軌跡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rogo 創始人 Gabe Stengel 說，模型已經比任何他認識的人都聰明，剩下的全是管道工程——誰把管道鋪進銀行的合規和系統記錄裡，誰就贏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企業銷售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rocky Statue deliberate monument unintentional monument Monument Lab slobs versus snobs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-ninepi-洛奇雕像不是艺术品-却成了费城拆不掉的地标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">32:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>洛奇雕像不是藝術品，卻成了費城拆不掉的地標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一尊為電影造的銅像，被藝術委員會否決、被搬去體育館、在倉庫裡躺過，最後靠的不是藝術價值，而是費城人認它——雕像的地位從來是觀眾給的，不是專家給的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共藝術</span><span class=\"tag\">城市史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 222 Vitamin K: Calling the shots vitamin K deficiency bleeding intramuscular injection kernicterus menaquinones phylloquinone GLA proteins\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-tpwky-维生素-k-注射被拒率翻倍-婴儿脑出血本可避免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>維生素 K 注射被拒率翻倍，嬰兒腦出血本可避免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有新生兒出生時都生理性缺乏維生素 K，一針肌肉注射能把晚期出血風險降到接近零；但美國拒打率從 3% 漲到 5.8%，拒打的嬰兒晚期出血風險高 81 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span><span class=\"tag\">兒科</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How will the US refill its dwindling oil reserves? Strategic Petroleum Reserve (SPR) royalty-in-kind Strait of Hormuz\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-indicator-美国战略石油储备见底-委内瑞拉石油救不了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>美國戰略石油儲備見底，委內瑞拉石油救不了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">鹽穴儲備已跌至1982年以來最低，過度取用正在溶解鹽層、讓洞穴結構失穩；委內瑞拉石油類型不同、還需1000億美元基礎設施投入，繞不開國會撥款這個死結。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源安全</span><span class=\"tag\">石油儲備</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Connecting with Kids Shouldn&#x27;t Be a Performance sportscasting\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-unruffled-让孩子表演不是连接-是在消耗他/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>讓孩子表演不是連接，是在消耗他</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連接不是讓孩子重複他會的東西來取悅你，而是觀察、接收、把他當一個人看待。表演式連接是快餐，吃完就沒了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">親子連接</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Beat the Pentagon’s Bureaucracy? CJADC2 NPIC time and materials token economics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-22-chinatalk-五角大楼不缺模型-缺的是把情报送到总统桌上的那条链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4924f7885153b4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>五角大樓不缺模型，缺的是把情報送到總統桌上的那條鏈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">U-2 偵察機真正的奇蹟不是飛機，是採購改革、情報分析機構和把判斷送到總統面前的那條鏈。今天 AI 已遠超政府整合能力，光有 API 不夠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">國防 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">採購改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why we procrastinate, and what actually helps (with Itamar Shatz) self-control fallacy decatastrophize zigzagger temporal motivation theory temptation bundling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-clearerthink-拖延不是意志力问题-下次你还会用同一个计划失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>拖延不是意志力問題：下次你還會用同一個計劃失敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拖延是明知有害卻仍推遲，約兩成成年人長期如此。焦慮、分心、倦怠、完美主義各有不同解法，但共同前提是：不換計劃，結果不會變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拖延</span><span class=\"tag\">行為科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jev: System One models for Prod, not God — with Diogo Almeida, CEO, TypeSafe AI mode dropping RLCD RLVR Noulli intelligence per dollar\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-latentspace-rlhf-的代价是-mode-dropping-不是对齐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d147c8ceaf2daa17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>RLHF 的代價是 mode dropping，不是對齊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RLHF 為了不出錯逼模型極度保守，把字符串概率分布整體毒化；TypeSafe 的 Jev 走另一條路，只優化 intelligence per dollar。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">RLHF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Naveen Rao: 4D Computing, AI&#x27;s Energy Wall &amp; Beating Biology dynamical systems theory von Neumann architecture sparsity Jevons paradox 4D computing state space trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-allin-ai-三年内会撞上能源墙-解法是造一台不像计算机的计算机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b757da5faf27af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年內會撞上能源牆，解法是造一臺不像計算機的計算機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 一家公司每月消耗 3.2 千萬億 token，按每 token 10 焦耳算就是 12 吉瓦，而全美數據中心總功率約 40 吉瓦。Naveen Rao 認為這個缺口只能靠換掉計算機的底層範式來填。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World is Running Out of Fuel strategic petroleum reserves tank bottoms dark fleet resin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-wsjournal-战略储备快见底-油价危机才真正开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>戰略儲備快見底，油價危機才真正開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">過去半年油價沒失控，靠的是戰略儲備、被制裁石油和中國少買這三塊緩衝墊；現在三塊都在被抽乾，真正的衝擊才要傳導到柴油和物價上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">油價</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Safety Language Is Destroying the Debate | Steven Sinofsky alignment telemetry CVE OPSEC SevOne, PriOne\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-a16z-ai-安全语言正在毁掉监管讨论-那是-bug-不是恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全語言正在毀掉監管討論：那是 bug，不是惡魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 出錯說成「未對齊」，等於給軟件加上意圖和道德判斷，讓國會和公眾無法理解到底發生了什麼——它本該被當作 bug 來調試、上報和修復。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">軟件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to Make a Difference: Part 1 learned helplessness explanatory style learned optimism agency axial age\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-hiddenbrain-乐观不是性格-是一套可以练的解释风格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>樂觀不是性格，是一套可以練的解釋風格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">無助是學來的，樂觀也是。決定人是否放棄的不是打擊本身，而是他把打擊解釋成永久、普遍、還是自己的錯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">習得性無助</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Moses and the Shaping of New York, Part 1 eminent domain parkway slum clearance Works Progress Administration\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-stuffmissed-他从未当选任何公职-却重塑了整座纽约/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>他從未當選任何公職，卻重塑了整座紐約</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Robert Moses 靠任命職位疊加權力，用公園和高速公路改寫紐約，也把種族偏見寫進了城市肌理——他的遺產至今仍在被爭論。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市治理</span><span class=\"tag\">基礎設施</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Miranda Fricker on Blame communicative blame reactive attitude apology stance epistemic blame\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-phibites-责备不是报复-哲学家主张我们该少责备一点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">23:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>責備不是報復：哲學家主張我們該少責備一點</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Miranda Fricker 認為報復式責備沒有道理，最有價值的責備是「溝通式責備」——目的是讓對方真正理解自己行為的道德意義，達成共享的道德理解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">道德哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">責備</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The current balance of power in open models open-weight distillation ATOM Project AAII KYC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-interconnects-中国开源权重模型领先-蒸馏只解释一两个月差距/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e33c5f20c0d489db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">17:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>中國開源權重模型領先，蒸餾只解釋一兩個月差距</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國模型在下載量和基準上全面領先，但蒸餾只解釋一到兩個月差距，真正原因是發布節奏和任務聚焦；美國公司正靠中國模型做產品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">中美競爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"368 | Elizabeth Alexander on Why Democracy Needs Imagination close reading Ars Poetica Hawks Nest mine disaster Mellon Foundation free people read freely\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-mindscape-诗歌不是民主的点缀-而是民主的支柱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>詩歌不是民主的點綴，而是民主的支柱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">禁書和規定老師不能教什麼，跟查禁新聞一樣是在動言論自由的根；一個集體是誰、看重什麼，全靠語言成形——藝術是民主的基礎設施，不是它的海報。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">詩歌</span><span class=\"tag\">人文學科</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Death of Reading (with James Marriott) post-literate society Republic of Letters Reading Revolution sitzfleisch\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-econtalk-识字率曾让欧洲民主化-如今却在倒退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>識字率曾讓歐洲民主化，如今卻在倒退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">書寫把人類交流從情緒化、面對面的口頭文化，冷卻成講證據、講邏輯的文本文化；識字率上升曾推動民主革命，而屏幕正在把公共話語拉回前識字時代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">閱讀</span><span class=\"tag\">媒介理論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli: complexity and value anapaestic decameter iambic pentameter Bloomsbury Group friction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-startweek-一杯水没有终极真相-量子力学逼我们放弃单一视角/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">42:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>一杯水沒有終極真相：量子力學逼我們放棄單一視角</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理學家 Carlo Rovelli 說，量子力學最深的啟示不是新粒子，而是啟蒙時代那個「獨立於觀察者的唯一客觀現實」的夢不成立——現實是互相豐富、但不收斂的多種視角。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子力學</span><span class=\"tag\">科學哲學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can CEO John Ternus find Apple&#x27;s next big thing? Hotel California Apple Silicon Cook Doctrine\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-decoder-苹果没有自己的前沿模型-却想靠折叠屏再赢一次/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bc9368ca7d5e1e5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">58:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>蘋果沒有自己的前沿模型，卻想靠摺疊屏再贏一次</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ternus 首秀講的是智能個人中樞，但整場發布會沒有一項新的 AI 功能；蘋果的 AI 靠 Google 模型撐著，而它真正的賭注押在摺疊屏和一堆還沒影的新品類上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘋果</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 硬件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ellen Correia Golay on All-to-All Trading and Treasury Market Liquidity all-to-all trading off-the-run principal trading firms (PTFs) central clearing cheapest to deliver agent clearing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-macromusings-美债市场真正的瓶颈-不是规模-是中间商不够用了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/236f8c497eab5e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">47:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Macro Musings</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美債市場真正的瓶頸：不是規模，是中間商不夠用了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一級交易商的資產負債表早已跟不上美債存量的增速，做市商讓位給高頻交易商，但後者在2020年3月集體撤退——這才是美債流動性問題的核心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美債</span><span class=\"tag\">市場結構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"This is how you rule the world pre-idea funding SAFE check Tree Hacks duck syndrome wantrepreneur\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-grayarea-斯坦福有一门秘密课程-教12个人如何从他人身上提取价值/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7c8b1deddea1e240-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Gray Area</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福有一門秘密課程，教12個人如何從他人身上提取價值</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這門課不寫進課程目錄，每年只收 12 人，由一位硅谷 CEO 教怎麼從人身上提取價值。作者說，學生撒謊不是意外，而是這套機制長期獎勵的結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span><span class=\"tag\">斯坦福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How LA Is Quietly Becoming America&#x27;s New Industrial Tech Hub fourth turning vertical integration lights out digital twin CapEx\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-oddlots-美国制造业空心化不是能力问题-是金融回报问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>美國製造業空心化不是能力問題，是金融回報問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chris Power 說美國把工業政策當對沖基金的財務報表來管，中國把工業政策當國家安全來管；關稅只是不完美的糾偏工具，核心是讓美國消費者不再補貼對手的工業能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">再工業化</span><span class=\"tag\">製造業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Banza: Brian Rudolph. The Chickpea Pasta That Nearly Turned to Mush elimination diet glyphosate Detox Project natural channel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-21-howibuilt-把鹰嘴豆意面煮成糊后-他靠-像泡茶一样泡-活了下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">58:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>把鷹嘴豆意麵煮成糊後，他靠「像泡茶一樣泡」活了下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Banza 的第一次規模化生產全線失敗，20,000 盒意麵一煮就爛。他們沒銷燬，而是貼上一張「像泡茶一樣泡」的貼紙發貨——因為不發貨就永遠失去這個零售商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品</span><span class=\"tag\">食品創業</span>\n</div></div></a>"]